Recommended citation
The publication is the preferred citation for this content, otherwise use:
avu #| output: asis #| label: lst-citation-code  library(nbaR)  library(knitr) library(rmarkdown)  # Code for fetching the yaml metadata # Note that this only runs when the .qmd file is rendered, therefore the outputs of this code block will return no results if you try to run it within R - that does not mean it is not working  meta &lt;- knitr::opts_knit$get("rmarkdown.pandoc.to")  # forces knitr to load metadata meta &lt;- rmarkdown::metadata  # full YAML is now in `meta`  nba_citation(meta)}
